            "description": "A walkthrough of the Brand Machine, a single system that pulls together everything needed to build a brand on your own. It starts with a daily news aggregator that tracks the channels and socials you follow for content ideas, then turns your typed or spoken script into a high-quality short with automatic video effects. Review it, hit post, and it goes out to all your socials, plus a section for repurposing your existing content into shorts.",
